include header

section.home-main
  img.main-img(src="/images/adopted.jpg" width=800 alt="Happy family with adopted pet")
  .main-text
    h2 Every Pet Deserves a Loving Home
    p At New Home Animal Rescue, we believe that every animal deserves a second chance at happiness. Our dedicated team rescues pets from shelters, stray situations, and difficult homes, giving them a safe environment, proper medical care, and plenty of love while they wait for their forever families. By adopting, you're not just gaining a companion - you're saving a life.

section.home-steps
  h2 How Adoption Works
  .steps-grid
    .step-card
      h3 1. Browse Pets
      p Explore our available animals and find your perfect match.
    .step-card
      h3 2. Submit Application
      p Tell us about your home and lifestyle so we can ensure a good fit.
    .step-card
      h3 3. Meet & Adopt
      p Meet your new companion and welcome them into your family!

section.home-why
  h2 Why Adopt From New Home?
  ul
    li ✔ Health-checked and vaccinated pets
    li ✔ Caring foster and shelter network
    li ✔ Support before and after adoption
    li ✔ Giving animals a second chance

section.home-cta
  h2 Ready to Change a Life?
  p Your new best friend is waiting.
  a.cta-button(href="/browse") Start Here

include footer
